OL,3,AMI5 chief warns of threats to UK from
OL,4,ARussia, Iran and AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe used an annual speech at the
OL,7,Fdomestic intelligence service's
OL,8,Fheadquarters in London to also warn of
OL,9,Frising threats from Iran and "extreme
OL,10,Fright-wing terrorism".
OL,12,FSir Ken added that MI5 had "caught
OL,13,Fterrorists seeking to exploit AI",
OL,14,Fincluding by integrating the technology
OL,15,Fwith drones - and warned the UK must
OL,16,Fstay ahead of the emerging threats like
OL,17,Fnew bioweapons.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
