OL,3,ABulgaria summons Russian ambassador
OL,4,Aafter ship sinks in Black Sea drone
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FBulgarian Prime Minister Rumen Radev
OL,8,Fhas summoned the Russian ambassador
OL,9,Fafter two merchant ships were struck by
OL,10,Fdrones off Bulgaria's Black Sea coast.
OL,12,FLocal officials say 11 crew of a
OL,13,FGuinea-Bissau-flagged vessel are
OL,14,Fmissing and five were saved after it
OL,15,Fsank 17 nautical miles (31km) east of
OL,16,Fthe village of Krapets.
OL,18,FThe other ship, Ukrainian owned, was
OL,19,Fhit by drones 18 nautical miles from
OL,20,Fthe town of Byala and all 15 crew were
OL,21,Frescued.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
